# Player guides. The GUIDE IS THE PAID PRODUCT now — it carries the cheat codes and
# the walkthrough, and it is the whole of what a Beta Nut member buys. This repo is
# PUBLIC and serves the GitHub Pages portal, so nothing under games/<slug>/guide/ may
# be committed: not the PDF, not the markdown it is rendered from, and above all not
# codes.toml. The renderer (apps/.../build_guide.py) and its print CSS
# (scripts/guide_styles/) stay in git; only the content leaves.
#
# ⚠️ games/vesper/guide/guide.md was committed before this rule (it was a layout
# sample) and is still in public history. Treat that draft as burned — this rule stops
# FUTURE guide content leaking, it cannot retract what already shipped.
#
# The guide has no version history while it lives here. Back it up off this repo.
games/*/guide/
*.pdf

